"ldn_n71_4qx","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-weigai:p003:m0118","surface":"瞻","start":118,"end":119,"person_id":"1r9_t7v_y0p","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-weigai:p003:m0121","surface":"該","start":121,"end":122,"person_id":"ldn_n71_4qx","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-weigai:p003:m0123","surface":"該","start":123,"end":124,"person_id":"ldn_n71_4qx","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-weigai:p003:m0132","surface":"周訪","start":132,"end":134,"person_id":"c6b_s71_vt7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-weigai:p003:m0136","surface":"杜曾","start":136,"end":138,"person_id":"4vd_pg5_o8x","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-weigai:p003:m0141","surface":"該","start":141,"end":142,"person_id":"ldn_n71_4qx","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-weigai","book_id":"b-jinshu-063","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-063-weigai-ws2025242"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045","text":"敦至石頭，欲攻劉隗，其將杜弘曰：「劉隗死士眾多，未易可克，不如攻石頭。周劄少恩，兵不為用，攻之必敗。劄敗，則隗自走。」敦從之。劄果開城門納弘。諸將與敦戰，王師敗績。既入石頭，擁兵不朝，放肆兵士劫掠內外。官省奔散，惟有侍中二人侍帝。帝脫戎衣，著朝服，顧而言曰：「欲得我處，但當早道，我自還琅邪，何至困百姓如此！」敦收周顗、戴若思害之。以敦為丞相、江州牧，進爵武昌郡公，邑萬戶，使太常荀崧就拜，又加羽葆鼓吹，並偽讓不受。還屯武昌，多害忠良，寵樹親戚，以兄含為衛將軍、都督沔南軍事、領南蠻校尉、荊州刺史，以義陽太守任愔督河北諸軍事、南中郎將，敦又自督寧、益二州。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"劉隗","kind":"person","person_id":"hnd_3at_h4i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line045:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"杜弘","kind":"person","pers